    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE SWEDISH LADY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A passenger who is excused by Poirot before investigating the murder scene."&lt;SEP&gt;"A weeping passenger worried about her family, displaying patience and Christian spirit despite difficulties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Swedish Lady contributes testimony that aids in the development of the plot or investigation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a290cdc5cb69e2a286069c682ea93990&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-828593a23e34b4ef40681f2f1551531c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97f221cfcb44e82fc16604e8188110e8</data>
