      <data key="d2">chunk-0262591c0f7139618aa8ff97ba9028ed</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STAMBOUL (ISTANBUL)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mentioned as a location where Miss Debenham considered stopping during her journey but decided against it."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stamboul (modern-day Istanbul) is referenced as a location where Poirot and MacQueen discussed their journey."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stamboul, also known as Istanbul, is the city Mrs. Hubbard traveled to before boarding the train for Smyrna."&lt;SEP&gt;"The city where the Orient Express was delayed, causing agitation for Mary Debenham due to her travel plans."</data>
