      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A city in Europe where a stop on the Orient Express journey occurs, potentially influencing passenger interactions or narrative developments."&lt;SEP&gt;"A city in Europe where the Orient Express makes a stop, potentially influencing interactions among passengers or the narrative's progression."&lt;SEP&gt;"A location mentioned as a train stop, significant for the narrative involving travel logistics and the planning of accommodations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A location where Mr. MacQueen went on the train platform before returning to his compartment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Belgrade is a geographical location where the Simplon Orient Express arrives before continuing its journey."&lt;SEP&gt;"Belgrade is mentioned as a location where an additional coach was attached to the train."</data>
