    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MACQUEEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A character who leaves Ratchett around 10:00 before the murder occurs."&lt;SEP&gt;"A restless passenger concerned about their prolonged stay on the train due to snow."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual who presents threatening letters to the Italian police regarding Ratchett’s situation."&lt;SEP&gt;"MacQueen is a character who initiates the departure on the Orient Express, showcasing leadership or stewardship."&lt;SEP&gt;"MacQueen is a character who recalls seeing individuals on a train, including a conductor and an unidentified woman, and discusses events related to a murder investigation."&lt;SEP&gt;"MacQueen is a companion to Ratchett who interacts with him in the restaurant car."&lt;SEP&gt;"MacQueen is a fellow passenger who interacted with Ratchett during meals on the train."&lt;SEP&gt;"MacQueen is a passenger discussing Indian policy with Colonel Arbuthrot."&lt;SEP&gt;"MacQueen is a suspect whose testimony reveals inconsistencies that suggest he knew about a note connected to Ratchett’s past and possibly had a role in his murder or cover-up."&lt;SEP&gt;"MacQueen is a young American secretary who was conversing with Colonel Arbuthnot at the time of the crime. He was not previously known to Arbuthnot but engaged in conversation about various topics such as India, Prohibition, and world politics."&lt;SEP&gt;"MacQueen is a young man who served as a secretary and courier for Mr. Ratchett, offering information about their travels and languages spoken on the train."&lt;SEP&gt;"MacQueen is an individual associated with the Armstrong case and is involved in the deception at twenty-three minutes to one, potentially trying to mislead Poirot about Ratchett's death time."&lt;SEP&gt;"MacQueen is described as a pleasant gentleman and a colleague of Mr. Ratchett; no bad blood exists between him and Mr. Ratchett."&lt;SEP&gt;"MacQueen is implicated in destroying real letters and placing misleading evidence like the handkerchief."&lt;SEP&gt;"MacQueen learns about a surviving word 'Armstrong' from a partially burnt letter and communicates this information to others involved in the plot."&lt;SEP&gt;"MacQueen was a fellow passenger and possibly an associate of Ratchett, who interacted with him during meals on the train."&lt;SEP&gt;"Poirot’s fellow traveler who dines in the restaurant car with Ratchett, participating minimally in conversations or observations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ratchett's secretary who provides an alibi for Colonel Arbuthnot, thus playing a part in the investigation of his death."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c02cf2a88ee1b375e65a1e1e19c6b6de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d78fe18a6cdc823562ae23bea032d2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e00f6f5a5a46007fccdffb363d3da9b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fd65fe3716ce22231f6ea5162982b25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d4cc4a3142e66b8dd0de74d27c22d1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43365b2b9f4f112313d61e10bcd53293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c6425d97244d2e1b3ba2690d999ff90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef2a5be101e1bcbe764f5cc6a651113&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38228728b48209be2f7a1ae5bf4db339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af707c4982d5d13c07eb2929dad417be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40b5b38b2dd23c77b4817324b15fd3d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-739553f4722a651ef8fe4bd2726b6a2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97f221cfcb44e82fc16604e8188110e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ee1f9ebf14192e2e1ce8e0eee9949ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37c5026a1b7465a5dd9fa6a338677957&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70a74ad1f7a65a442e84243a05d21bd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffec81d1a6e4064edf1aa47ab020e43d</data>
    </node>
