    <node id="&quot;SAMUEL EDWARD RATCHETT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Also known as Cassetti, Samuel Edward Ratchett was the victim of the crime aboard the Orient Express."&lt;SEP&gt;"Samuel Edward Ratchett, also known by an alias, was an American citizen with a secretive past. He employed Hector MacQueen and was receiving threatening letters until he was murdered."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3b935beff32f900e8b2f9a059a1a90d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-854a7ec825bca51df1d6a969ff1fe76e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE ORIENT EXPRESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Orient Express is a famous long-distance passenger train service that features as the setting for Agatha Christie's novel 'Murder on the Orient Express'."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Orient Express is the location where a murder takes place, central to the investigation led by Poirot."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Orient Express is the setting for Agatha Christie's 'Murder on the Orient Express', where a murder investigation takes place."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Orient Express is the setting for Agatha Christie's 'Murder on the Orient Express,' where a murder investigation takes place."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Orient Express is the setting for a murder investigation led by Poirot. It's a train journey involving multiple passengers and a crime scene."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Orient Express is the setting for a murder mystery involving Ratchett’s death and Poirot's investigation into the identities and motives of those involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Orient Express is the setting for a murder mystery, serving as a confined space where the crime and subsequent investigation take place."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Orient Express refers to the luxurious train journey that serves as the setting for Agatha Christie's novel where Samuel Edward Ratchett was murdered."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Orient Express refers to the train on which the murder takes place, serving as a significant location for the plot."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Orient Express refers to the train setting where the murder mystery occurs in Agatha Christie's novel."&lt;SEP&gt;"The famous long-distance passenger train service where the murder takes place; a central setting for the mystery."&lt;SEP&gt;"The setting of 'Murder on the Orient Express,' where an investigation unfolds involving multiple characters."&lt;SEP&gt;"The train setting for the mystery, where characters interact and revelations occur regarding a past crime involving Daisy Armstrong."&lt;SEP&gt;"The train where Mr. MacQueen, Poirot, and others are passengers during an investigation related to Ratchett's murder."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6d78fe18a6cdc823562ae23bea032d2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90462864ccc3552f8203a4d315744169&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca0b6967cd3627682b57dc6562a6d401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b935beff32f900e8b2f9a059a1a90d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-943f6d42e5d505073e2dc802d2e65542&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc69e98e6913ae79fe45aa1a57ea357e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c6425d97244d2e1b3ba2690d999ff90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c079a095f377928fe8ac396a4a1a138a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-525a2be9aa2fefc69a55692560d1211f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38e5b19416dc42d6ed9bbd0880c6ecea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-739553f4722a651ef8fe4bd2726b6a2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aabf3f278593d24c8e7cd53fbcd961f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdcbbccf1561d4915ce0f64536c1893b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3ee36d6bef7ec1eb1413cc372b39bec</data>
    </node>
