    <node id="&quot;MASTERMAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Masterman is Ratchett's valet, described as someone who keeps to himself and has low opinions of Americans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Masterman is a valet serving Mr. Ratchett, known for his inexpressive demeanor and preference for reading over socializing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Masterman, along with Hector MacQueen, was engaged in Ratchett’s employment to facilitate the plot."&lt;SEP&gt;"The valet of Colonel Armstrong, who discloses his past employment with Armstrong during the investigation."</data>
