      <data key="d1">"An economic event referenced during discussions between MacQueen and Colonel Arbuthnot; likely refers to the Great Depression era's financial struggles."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cdcbbccf1561d4915ce0f64536c1893b</data>
    </node>
