      <data key="d2">chunk-6d78fe18a6cdc823562ae23bea032d2c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARMSTRONG KIDNAPPING CASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A notorious crime case involving the abduction of Charles Lindbergh's son, mentioned by Greta Ohlsson as an example of evil men."&lt;SEP&gt;"An infamous real-world event, the Armstrong kidnapping case, is referenced in relation to M. Ratchett, suggesting a motive or background story."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Armstrong kidnapping case is a historical criminal event that Mr. Ratchett was involved in as a principal instigator, which becomes relevant during the investigation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6d78fe18a6cdc823562ae23bea032d2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e73450c21b26b1c97cae9c9cc4f33121&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70a74ad1f7a65a442e84243a05d21bd7</data>
    </node>
