      <data key="d2">chunk-70a74ad1f7a65a442e84243a05d21bd7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AMERICAN LADY (MRS. HUBBARD)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The American lady, Mrs. Hubbard, is a passenger on the Orient Express who experiences an unsettling event involving someone in her compartment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dc69e98e6913ae79fe45aa1a57ea357e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONDUCTOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Role associated with Michel, who is involved in providing information about the locked state of a compartment door."&lt;SEP&gt;"The conductor is mentioned as someone who makes beds on the train, likely part of the staff responsible for passenger comfort."&lt;SEP&gt;"The conductor of the train is mentioned by Foscarelli regarding making beds in the compartments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The conductor provides crucial testimony about the timeline of events and who entered or left Mr. Ratchett’s compartment during specific times."&lt;SEP&gt;"The train conductor who responds to M. Ratchett's bell and communicates that Ratchett was not wanted in French, suggesting involvement or knowledge about the crime."&lt;SEP&gt;"The train's conductor interacts with Mrs. Hubbard when she reports seeing a man in her compartment and has issues ringing for help."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-90462864ccc3552f8203a4d315744169&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-943f6d42e5d505073e2dc802d2e65542&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc69e98e6913ae79fe45aa1a57ea357e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d4c5ec355b91832ff6974cba34014c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c6425d97244d2e1b3ba2690d999ff90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23f5533179a24abef3edb831a2667e0c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMPARTMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A section of the train where Mrs. Hubbard is staying and experiences a suspicious incident during the night."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dc69e98e6913ae79fe45aa1a57ea357e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADJACENT COMPARTMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The nearby compartment to Mrs. Hubbard's, which she suspects was involved in her unsettling experience due to an unfastened door."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dc69e98e6913ae79fe45aa1a57ea357e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MME. HUBBARD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mme. Hubbard is a passenger on the train who provides crucial testimony about her experiences and observations related to Mr. Ratchett's murder."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mme. Hubbard is another passenger on the Orient Express, whose compartment's door was locked, playing into the investigation narrative."&lt;SEP&gt;"She is the wife of Mr. Hubbard and part of the group involved in executing Cassetti's sentence."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-90462864ccc3552f8203a4d315744169&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27c2fe5c17ad711c386f6cdce1c5b966&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-857357aeeee56eaf90ec14021d2a1053</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARMSTRONG KIDNAP CASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A notorious criminal case involving the kidnapping of a child named Armstrong. Cassetti (Ratchett) was implicated but evaded justice until his assassination on the Orient Express."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-27c2fe5c17ad711c386f6cdce1c5b966</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SWEDISH GIRL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Swedish girl, mentioned by Mme. Hubbard, inadvertently opened the door of Ratchett's compartment and was upset about interacting with him."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-27c2fe5c17ad711c386f6cdce1c5b966</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRETA OHLSSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Swedish lady who weeps upon realizing her connection to a past tragedy and confesses her role as Daisy Armstrong's nurse."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greta Ohlsson is a Swedish subject who was the last person to see Ratchett alive, providing an alibi for Mary Debenham from midnight to 2 A.M."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greta Ohlsson is a forty-nine-year-old matron at a missionary school near Stamboul, who speaks French and has encountered a recent crime."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greta Ohlsson provides testimonies about Miss Debenham and the valet, supporting their alibis with her observations during the investigation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greta Ohlsson provides testimonies about Miss Debenham and the valet, supporting their alibis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greta Ohlsson, a Swedish lady, was initially asleep but became agitated upon being woken. Her luggage contained meager possessions including sal ammoniac."&lt;SEP&gt;"Swedish lady who last saw Ratchett alive at 10.40 reading a book."&lt;SEP&gt;"Witnesses Ratchett last alive at 10.40, observing him awake and reading a book."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ca0b6967cd3627682b57dc6562a6d401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43365b2b9f4f112313d61e10bcd53293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9852ab845971db75c2a83895116dfabc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d2377471b4daac2b86e49ff3b3cd311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e73450c21b26b1c97cae9c9cc4f33121&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23f5533179a24abef3edb831a2667e0c</data>
    </node>
