    <node id="&quot;ANTONIO FOSCARELLI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Antonio Foscarelli corroborates Greta Ohlsson's statements regarding other passengers' locations during the investigation, adding to the collective evidence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antonio Foscarelli corroborates Greta Ohlsson's statements regarding other passengers' locations during the investigation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antonio Foscarelli is a second-class passenger on the Orient Express who will be questioned by Poirot regarding the murder."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antonio Foscarelli is a second-class passenger who will be questioned by Poirot regarding the murder onboard the train."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antonio Foscarelli is an American subject (Italian by birth) who vouched for Edward Masterman's alibi from midnight to 2 A.M."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antonio Foscarelli is an Italian passenger on the Orient Express who becomes a suspect during Poirot’s investigation. He exhibits nervous behavior when questioned by Poirot."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antonio Foscarelli is an Italian-American described as a Ford motor car agent and appears as a key witness with a vividly detailed testimony about his business acumen and life in America."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antonio Foscarelli is another passenger who vouches for Edward Masterman’s alibi during the investigation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9d4c5ec355b91832ff6974cba34014c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9852ab845971db75c2a83895116dfabc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c992fd77a9a07d04ba95f4a1c5b07f24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23f5533179a24abef3edb831a2667e0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94520989a3204d455132c5bb78aeef3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3ee36d6bef7ec1eb1413cc372b39bec</data>
    </node>
