    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YOUNG MACQUEEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A character who might be able to confirm Mr. Hardman’s identity as he has seen him in his father's office in New York."&lt;SEP&gt;"Young MacQueen is a character mentioned by Mr. Hardman as someone who might confirm his identity, having seen him in his father's office in New York."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8bc7f212f7cc245171a145500065be35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d4c5ec355b91832ff6974cba34014c8</data>
